==Event Information==
Characters from Princess Punt Sweets are available to unlock in the Battle Cats via the collaboration event period.

*【Special】 [[Cat Princess (Special Cat)|Cat Princess]] - Chance to obtain when playing the ''Princess Punt'' Limited Stage, with greater chance as the player progresses to harder levels. Using a Treasure Radar provides a guaranteed drop.
*【Special】 [[Kerihime (Special Cat)|Kerihime]] - Obtained during the start of the Collab Event.
:*'''Collaboration Fixed Stage'''

Collaboration Stages are available to play in the [[Legend Stages]] menu from the title screen. These stages are colored in purple, which include characters from Princess Punt as enemies. The only stage to become available is Princess Punt, of which has the Special Cat "[[Cat Princess (Special Cat)|Cat Princess]]" as a Treasure. As the player progresses to more difficult levels, there is a better chance to unlock this unit. Using a Treasure Radar when clearing any level will drop this character in one-shot.

Clear all the levels in the Princess Punt map to receive 30 [[Cat Food]] and 1 [[Cat Energy|Leadership]].

