:'''Removed in later versions'''
From the first release, tapping the button at the bottom of the collaboration poster, which is accessible through the "i" button, will reward you [[Kerihime (Special Cat)|Kerihime]] and a Rare Ticket. If you already have Kerihime, 1 Rare Ticket can still be received.

